exact historical policy metrics unavailable outside excluded frozen artifacts  \n**Recommended next focus**: Audit remaining fleet-wide authority, PASS, metric, and enforcement claims against promoted evidence.\n\n**Files written**:\n- `research/iterations/iteration-003.md`\n- `research/deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one canonical append\n- `research/deltas/iter-003.jsonl`\n- `research/research.md` — progressively updated\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Delta canonical record matches state: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes, 5/5\n- Mandatory live route proof: yes, all seven hubs exercised\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- Sub-dispatch: none\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","sessionId":"ses_06ddfbb24ffe4e05oaMgpJUf33","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Compare parent runtime truth","time":{"start":1784863016327,"end":1784863411423}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0b9e3c871ac21f66016a62d91f3a4881918c8944d203eaa2cc"}},"id":"prt_f92202224001TRVmdFokYRXSVQ","sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","messageID":"msg_f92200ad3001H3Jiqcbg7cNgjW"}}
