",\"frozen research/benchmark/lineage/output/log artifacts as defect candidates\"],\"focusTrack\":\"lifecycle-resume\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"019/graph-metadata.json\",\"020-router-unification-program/graph-metadata.json\",\"020/007/graph-metadata.json and spec.md\",\"020/007/015/graph-metadata.json and spec.md\",\"020/007/015/013 and 016 graph-metadata.json\",\"system-spec-kit shared/gate-3-classifier.ts\",\"system-spec-kit runtime/lib/spec-gate/spec-gate-core.mjs\",\"git cat-file against 140266be3e^\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-24T00:20:00Z\",\"durationMs\":600000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":3,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Parent routing canon versus live compiled-routing runtime and all seven hubs\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All five findings are new to this lineage: two commit-introduced contradictions, two pre-existing live-contract/enforcement gaps, and one commit-introduced metric-provenance gap.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"q3\",\"q4-links\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"q3\",\"q4-links\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"seven-hub identity ambiguity\",\"defaultMode inventory drift\",\"resourceContractVersion or manifest population drift\"],\"focusTrack\":\"routing-runtime-conformance\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Skill\",\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"parent routing-config-and-advisor-reference.md\",\"parent routing-before-after.md\",\"parent context-index.md\",\"parent spec.md\",\".opencode/bin/lib/compiled-routing/serving-closure.manifest.json\",\"compiled runtime resolve.cjs and compiled-route.cjs\",\"all seven hub routing surfaces\",\"parent-skill-check.cjs output\",\"git show 140266