{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784863853705,"sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_3gcFh1PkyEPjs3H8f19US41X","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Audit full tree links","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Execute exactly ONE iteration (iteration 4) for the detached lineage, state-first, with writes only under `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/research/round-3-sol/lineages/sol` (iteration-004, one state append, iter-004 delta, optional research.md). Reducer files read-only. Focus: audit cross-document links anywhere in the full 019 packet tree, but exclude `research/**`, `benchmark/**`, `lineages/**`, `*.out`, `*.log`, and run-record artifacts as defect candidates. Check Markdown links, backticked repo paths, JSON path references, parent/child links, and relative links. Find broken targets, stale names, links that resolve only from CWD but are not repo-rooted, and ambiguous nested references. Prioritize parent docs changed by 140266be3e, then sample/scan all canonical child docs. Verify each report against the actual target. Every finding: P1/P2, NEW/PRE-EXISTING, exact file:line and target evidence. Do not report frozen historical links. Max-iterations stop policy; convergence is telemetry only. Mandatory route proof. No sub-dispatch."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_06dd7a0a0ffefTLqo0QdXzBJ6I\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 4 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Full-tree cross-document link audit with commit attribution  \n**Findings**: 4 findings (4 new to lineage; 1 NEW, 3 PRE-EXISTING)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 1.0  \n**Questions answered**: Canonical link validity and `140266be3e` link attribution  \n**Questions remaining**: 2  \n**Edge cases**: Partial success—the broad JSON heuristic was rejected due to logical-ID false positives  \n**Recommended next focus**: Audit remaining fleet-wide PASS, authority, metric, and enforcement claims\n\n**Files written**:\n- `research/iterations/iteration-004.md`\n- `research/deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one iteration appended\n- `research/deltas/iter-004.jsonl`\n- `research/research.md` — updated\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Delta first record byte-equivalent: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Mandatory route proof recorded: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- No sub-dispatch: yes\n- Stop policy remains max-iterations\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","sessionId":"ses_06dd7a0a0ffefTLqo0QdXzBJ6I","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Audit full tree links","time":{"start":1784863547403,"end":1784863853687}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08482a991eb70714016a62db3b09588199a202a7d50753a2b0"}},"id":"prt_f92285efe001ZIXQaS4mgtGi5o","sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","messageID":"msg_f9227dea3001gBlz2MrKYfR6pA"}}
