{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784864194301,"sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_1OeSLaA3Ufh9OtFeTEAKew7Y","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Audit fleet-wide claims","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Execute exactly ONE iteration (iteration 5) for the detached lineage. Read lineage state first. Writes only within `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/research/round-3-sol/lineages/sol`: iteration-005, exactly one state iteration append, iter-005 delta, optional progressive research.md. Reducer-owned files read-only. Focus: audit broad fleet-wide PASS, authoritative, complete, enforced, verified, and metric claims in canonical parent and child docs against current promoted non-frozen evidence and executable checkers. Include compiled-routing activation/closure, seven hubs, parent-skill-check invariants, route-gold/coverage claims, and any lifecycle completion overclaims. Do not use excluded frozen research/benchmark/lineage/log/run-record artifacts as defect evidence. Distinguish a false claim from an evidence-provenance limitation. Every finding P1/P2, NEW/PRE-EXISTING, exact file:line, actual confirming/contradicting source. Continue despite convergence. Mandatory route proof. No sub-dispatch."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_06dd1dd88ffeIdwn8wtwUaAy6y\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 5 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Fleet-wide PASS, authority, enforcement, metric, and lifecycle completion claims  \n**Findings**: 4 findings (3 new, 0 partially new, 1 redundant)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.75  \n**Questions answered**: `q-fleet-claims`  \n**Questions remaining**: 2  \n**Edge cases**: Contradictory evidence; metric provenance limitation  \n**Recommended next focus**: Nested lifecycle consistency outside the primary `019/020/007/015` path\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-005.md`\n- `deltas/iter-005.jsonl`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one iteration appended\n- `research.md` — progressively updated\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Delta/state canonical records match: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes, 4/4\n- Mandatory seven-hub route proof: passed\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","sessionId":"ses_06dd1dd88ffeIdwn8wtwUaAy6y","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Audit fleet-wide claims","time":{"start":1784863925051,"end":1784864194296}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0959f614f6b99cb0016a62dcaa3114819197eae451bd235379"}},"id":"prt_f922df8ee001p3FRuNAidHdTpf","sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","messageID":"msg_f922db80b001LWQUV3odAItL3t"}}
