{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784865020664,"sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_Snxr6W7xauaOqpQ1T4dLb2GT","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Correct iteration state check","subagent_type":"deep-research","task_id":"ses_06dc83230ffe3H5tXJGBxfqVif","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Correction based on verified current filesystem evidence: your prior hard block was wrong. The exact detached root `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/research/round-3-sol/lineages/sol` has config `maxIterations: 10`, state log only lines 1-7 with iterations 1-6, and neither `iterations/iteration-007.md` nor `deltas/iter-007.jsonl` exists. You inspected a different packet. Re-read the exact absolute paths under `/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/research/round-3-sol/lineages/sol`, then execute iteration 7 exactly as originally dispatched. Do not inspect or write another lineage. Exact mandatory resolved_route string required. No sub-dispatch."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_06dc83230ffe3H5tXJGBxfqVif\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 7 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Audited all eight `020/005` idea children for documentation completeness, lifecycle truth, metadata agreement, pointer semantics, links, and commit attribution.  \n**Findings**: 4 findings (3 new, 1 partially new, 0 redundant)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.88  \n**Questions answered**: Eight-child audit, links/pointers, and `140266be3e` attribution  \n**Questions remaining**: Changed-hunk review and final severity deduplication  \n**Edge cases**: Contradictory evidence  \n**Recommended next focus**: Line-by-line canonical changed-hunk review of commit `140266be3e`\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-007.md`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one canonical append\n- `deltas/iter-007.jsonl`\n- `research.md` — progressively updated\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Delta/state canonical records equivalent: yes\n- Mandatory `resolved_route` exact: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- No sub-dispatch: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","sessionId":"ses_06dc83230ffe3H5tXJGBxfqVif","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Correct iteration state check","time":{"start":1784864720545,"end":1784865020659}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_076b100209c448b0016a62dfcab3e88191a727d23d3804182a"}},"id":"prt_f923a2fef001oYfN3UPF4l3qqu","sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","messageID":"msg_f923a0d33001ItdqeKaqUSY1wH"}}
