40-68\",\"spec.md:124-134\",\"020/005 spec.md and graph-metadata.json\",\"021 graph-metadata.json\",\"current canonical source anchors listed in iteration-009.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-24T05:10:00Z\",\"durationMs\":600000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":10,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"route\":\"mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"routeProof\":{\"mode\":\"research\",\"targetAgent\":\"deep-research\",\"agentDefinitionLoaded\":true,\"noSubdispatch\":true},\"run\":10,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"Terminal mechanical verification of canonical findings, lineage artifacts, route proof, packet boundaries, exclusions, and max-iteration stop semantics\",\"findingsCount\":0,\"newInfoRatio\":0.1,\"noveltyJustification\":\"No new defect was found; the +0.10 simplicity bonus reflects terminal closure of anchor validity, artifact integrity, route deviations, exclusion discipline, and stop semantics.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"q-terminal-anchor-verification\",\"q-terminal-artifact-integrity\",\"q-terminal-route-proof\",\"q-terminal-stop\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"q-terminal-anchor-verification\",\"q-terminal-artifact-integrity\",\"q-terminal-route-proof\",\"q-terminal-stop\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"canonical source-anchor correction\",\"severity or provenance count correction\",\"rewriting prior append-only route strings\",\"promotion of excluded artifact classes\",\"iteration 11\"],\"focusTrack\":\"terminal-mechanical-verification\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"ApplyPatch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"deep-research-config.json\",\"deep-research-state.jsonl\",\"deep-research-strategy.md\",\"iterations/iteration-009.md\",\"62 canonical source anchors\",\"iterations/iteration-001.md through iteration-010.md\",\"deltas/iter-001.jsonl through iter-010.jsonl\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-24T04:07:03Z\",\"durationMs\":420000,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"graphEvents\":[]}","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/research/round-3-sol/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl","text":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":9,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"routeProof\":{\"mode\":\"research\",\"targetAgent\":\"deep-research\",\"agentDefinitionLoaded\":true,\"noSubdispatch\":true},\"run\":9,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"Reconcile and deduplicate all findings from iterations 1-8 into a canonical severity and provenance-normalized set\",\"findingsCount\":27,\"newInfoRatio\":0.1,\"noveltyJustification\":\"No external defect was new; the +0.10 simplicity bonus reflects a complete duplicate map, mixed-provenance split, severity normalization, and removal of a provenance limitation from the defect set.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"q-final-deduplication\",\"q-severity-normalization\",\"q-provenance-normalization\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"q-final-deduplication\",\"q-severity-normalization\",\"q-provenance-normalization\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"91/106 and 91/91 arithmetic as false rather than provenance-limited\",\"fleet compiled activation as false\",\"canonical full-ID collision for duplicate 012 prefixes\",\"015 child-count mismatch\",\"iteration-8 topology and metadata candidates\"],\"focusTrack\":\"finding-reconciliation\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Glob\",\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"ApplyPatch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"iterations/iteration-001.md through iteration-008.md\",\"routing-before-after.md:145-161\",\"020/001/verification-report.md:40-58\",\"routing-config-and-advisor-reference.md:40-68\",\"spec.md:124-134\",\"020/005 spec.md and graph-metadata.json\",\"021 graph-metadata.json\",\"current canonical source anchors listed in iteration-009.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-24T05:10:00Z\",\"durationMs\":600000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":10,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"route\":\"mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"routeProof\":{\"mode\":\"research\",\"targetAgent\":\"deep-research\",\"agentDefinitionLoaded\":true,\"noSubdispatch\":true},\"run\":10,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"Terminal mechanical verification of canonical findings, lineage artifacts, route proof, packet boundaries, exclusions, and max-iteration stop semantics\",\"findingsCount\":0,\"newInfoRatio\":0.1,\"noveltyJustification\":\"No new defect was found; the +0.10 simplicity bonus reflects terminal closure of anchor validity, artifact integrity, route deviations, exclusion discipline, and stop semantics.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"q-terminal-anchor-verification\",\"q-terminal-artifact-integrity\",\"q-terminal-route-proof\",\"q-terminal-stop\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"q-terminal-anchor-verification\",\"q-terminal-artifact-integrity\",\"q-terminal-route-proof\",\"q-terminal-stop\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"canonical source-anchor correction\",\"severity or provenance count correction\",\"rewriting prior append-only route strings\",\"promotion of excluded artifact classes\",\"iteration 11\"],\"focusTrack\":\"terminal-mechanical-verification\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"ApplyPatch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"deep-research-config.json\",\"deep-research-state.jsonl\",\"deep-research-strategy.md\",\"iterations/iteration-009.md\",\"62 canonical source anchors\",\"iterations/iteration-001.md through iteration-010.md\",\"deltas/iter-001.jsonl through iter-010.jsonl\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-24T04:07:03Z\",\"durationMs\":420000,\"stopRea