rations=10 under max-iterations policy.\",\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"source\":\"deep-research-config.json:3-16\"}","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/research/round-3-sol/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-010.jsonl","text":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":10,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"route\":\"mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"routeProof\":{\"mode\":\"research\",\"targetAgent\":\"deep-research\",\"agentDefinitionLoaded\":true,\"noSubdispatch\":true},\"run\":10,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"Terminal mechanical verification of canonical findings, lineage artifacts, route proof, packet boundaries, exclusions, and max-iteration stop semantics\",\"findingsCount\":0,\"newInfoRatio\":0.1,\"noveltyJustification\":\"No new defect was found; the +0.10 simplicity bonus reflects terminal closure of anchor validity, artifact integrity, route deviations, exclusion discipline, and stop semantics.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"q-terminal-anchor-verification\",\"q-terminal-artifact-integrity\",\"q-terminal-route-proof\",\"q-terminal-stop\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"q-terminal-anchor-verification\",\"q-terminal-artifact-integrity\",\"q-terminal-route-proof\",\"q-terminal-stop\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"canonical source-anchor correction\",\"severity or provenance count correction\",\"rewriting prior append-only route strings\",\"promotion of excluded artifact classes\",\"iteration 11\"],\"focusTrack\":\"terminal-mechanical-verification\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"ApplyPatch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"deep-research-config.json\",\"deep-research-state.jsonl\",\"deep-research-strategy.md\",\"iterations/iteration-009.md\",\"62 canonical source anchors\",\"iterations/iteration-001.md through iteration-010.md\",\"deltas/iter-001.jsonl through iter-010.jsonl\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-24T04:07:03Z\",\"durationMs\":420000,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"iteration\":10,\"category\":\"canonical-verification\",\"detail\":\"All 27 canonical findings retain 62/62 resolvable source anchors; counts remain 22 P1/5 P2 and 4 NEW/23 PRE-EXISTING.\",\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-009.md:8-38\"}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"iteration\":10,\"category\":\"route-deviation\",\"detail\":\"Iterations 6 and 8 suffix the canonical resolved_route; prior append-only records remain unchanged. Iteration 10 records exact resolved_route, explicit route, and structured routeProof.\",\"source\":\"deep-research-state.jsonl:2-11\"}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"iteration\":10,\"category\":\"terminal-stop\",\"detail\":\"The tenth canonical iteration reaches maxIterations=10 under max-iterations policy.\",\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"source\":\"deep-research-config.json:3-16\"}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":4,"totalLines":4,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/research/round-3-sol/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-010.jsonl","time":{"start":1784866187410,"end":1784866187422}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_04c20fbbe78a785d016a62e58b4bd08191b4973c93bbcb2662"}},"id":"prt_f9250a873001e2tg09xbL5vQv1","sessionID":"ses_06df05187ffeYScgmqkSqD6Jbx","messageID":"msg_f925058e80018DJ3YalcYA1Hzn"}}
